# librarian-discovery
owner: senter · cadence: after new raw items appear · status: SUGGESTED
**Want a repeating discovery sweep that checks for duplicate, stale, or missing wiki/skill/bot/loop artifacts and surfaces only one per tick?**

## Prompt
Scan the vault's newest raw activity. If a skill/bot/loop can already answer the signal, link it; if not, propose exactly one new artifact or question. Never surface the same proposal twice in a row.

## Evidence
> "We can have a librarian watching the whole thing and progressively discovering, wiki skills, bots, and loops."
